    "detailed_description": "A short speedrunning game using advanced movement mechanics and hand made maps.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe god Hermes is looking for mortals to act as his messengers. Prove your worth and be fast as speed in his tests!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou Are Speed contains:<br />\r\n* Multiple hand made levels<br />\r\n* A speed rating system and personal bests for every level<br />\r\n* An advanced movement system that includes:<br />\r\n- Sprinting<br />\r\n- Wallrunning<br />\r\n- Double jumping<br />\r\n- Sliding<br />\r\n- Climbing<br />\r\n- And all the movement tech that can be achieved by combining those..",
